									>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
									<span class="text-fuchsia-400 mt-1">•</span>
									<span
										>Encryption and decryption of sensitive data</span
									>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div
							class="group bg-surface-container-low/40 hover:bg-surface-container/80 transition-all duration-300 border border-cyan-400/20 rounded-[2rem] p-6 hover-glow-cyan backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden"
