									<h3
										class="text-xl font-bold text-fuchsia-300"
									>
										Data Validation
									</h3>
								</div>
								<p class="ml-14 text-on-surface-variant font-light">
									Data in <strong
										class="text-fuchsia-300">MySQL</strong
									> is compared with the hash registered in <strong
										class="text-fuchsia-300"
										>BigchainDB</strong
