								</p>
							</div>

							<div class="border-t border-fuchsia-400/20 pt-8">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
									<div
										class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-500/20 flex items-center justify-center"
									>
										<span class="text-fuchsia-400 font-bold"
											>3</span
										>
									</div>
									<h3
										class="text-xl font-bold text-fuchsia-300"
									>
										Encryption and Decryption
									</h3>
								</div>
								<p class="ml-14 text-on-surface-variant font-light">
									Data is encrypted before being stored.
									Only authorized users can
									decrypt it. Immutable records in
									BigchainDB.
								</p>
							</div>
